From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 06:40:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 74/93] arm64: dts: apple: t6050-k116s: enable the video
 encoder's power states

iBoot leaves VENC0_SYS on (PS word 0xf0003ff). Its node is disabled on
the K116s, so nothing ever turns it off, and FAB0_SOC stays up behind
it. The J714s enables these power states for its encoder.

With VENC0_SYS on, the SoC does not enter the firmware-driven sleep:
the whole entry runs, and the machine resets about 5 s after the commit
word. macOS has VENC0_SYS off at its commit on this board (register
state read with macOS as an aura guest, the commit withheld).

Enable ps_fab1_piogw (firmware-owned), ps_fab0_soc (always-on) and the
ps_venc0_* states as on the J714s. Unused, genpd turns them off at
boot. No encoder is described yet.

Tested on a K116s: venc0-sys and its children read off after boot, and
the J714s commit sequence then sleeps.

Signed-off-by: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>

[re-cut onto the K114s r3d tree]
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-k116s.dts | 39 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 39 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-k116s.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-k116s.dts
index 4143dd9b19e..69fdab4eccb 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-k116s.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t6050-k116s.dts
@@ -940,3 +940,42 @@ pmu_rtc: rtc {
 		wakeup-source;
 	};
 };
+
+/*
+ * The video encoder's power states, as on the J714s. iBoot leaves VENC0_SYS on, and the SoC does
+ * not enter the firmware-driven sleep with it on. Enabled and unused, genpd turns it off at
+ * boot. No encoder is described yet.
+ */
+&ps_fab1_piogw {
+	apple,firmware-owned;
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_fab0_soc {
+	apple,always-on;
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_venc0_sys {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_venc0_dma {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_venc0_pipe4 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_venc0_pipe5 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_venc0_me0 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ps_venc0_me1 {
+	status = "okay";
+};
